00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.440
¡Cuarenta millones, tres veces!

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.080
Sold!

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.480
The winning bid goes

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.680
to the lady with number eight.

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.760
This is for you, grandpa.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:18.840
I brought back everything

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.240
that was ours.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.560
Enjoying your pictures, dear?

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:30.360
That mourning veil suits you.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.400
But don’t think you can hide behind it.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.880
By the way,

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:42.960
your husband has a surprise for you.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.800
Check your phone.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:59.640
Mason: Escape from my brother’s claws?

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:02.040
 I’m at “The Rose” room 434.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:05.080
Won’t sleep until i kiss those charm.
